 "Removed throughputs - use rubin_sim_data.throughputs", "created_at": "2022-09-18T03:08:47Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ce3cb0ab7dc3b02922cc9c74c6348e4fc041e14d", "message": "Added white dwarf to photTools.py", "created_at": "2015-04-15T19:54:49Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ed364169069c0aab74618b8517dd53117b265c6", "message": "Added white dwarfs", "created_at": "2015-04-15T19:54:33Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5962c757015dbabebee94ac674ff4fc73c11895f", "message": "Updated Sed/Bandpass, added new method to photTools", "created_at": "2015-04-13T19:21:50Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e53f73ac9188a6394b6bc639f99779efd0a5a9e", "message": "Added calc_m5.py example and updated Bandpass/Sed (mostly comment changes).", "created_at": "2013-05-09T19:32:38Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f5cc7ea8cffb0d0a28c3b00d4158559817fb430", "message": "Made it easier to use default seeing values in different filters.\n\nAllowed setting a 'filter' (to use default seeing in that filter)\ninstead of automatically selecting seeing in r band.", "created_at": "2013-03-13T23:21:45Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "673c3c63d9dd2e8aecab270324611ebaa502b670", "message": "Corrected errors in the calculation of SNR (only applicable in the case of gain!=1).", "created_at": "2012-08-09T23:23:35Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e8304443038c8759106b3be6a097fdf1b9fa1d9", "message": "Added LSST licensing info, added some clarity to Bandpass regarding wavelength limits.\n\nMoved wavelen_min/_max/_step into internal variables to Bandpass, to\nmake it easier to use nondefault values.", "created_at": "2012-07-26T23:06:27Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82df1b7928742b59d0e869bd650f02e873033e4c", "message": "Added note on natural vs instrumental magnitudes.", "created_at": "2012-06-27T19:53:41Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "484b295c15ed9d65222a775df4b57ab5dbeacb91", "message": "Added photoZ outlier templates, updated photTools to include these.\n\nAlso added plots of the new SED curves. The photoZ_outlier curves are\nSED templates considered most likely to result in photoZ catastrophic\nfailures.", "created_at": "2012-06-26T06:28:37Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7976bb3f060b8d1a73a961cfaa3a36cf043c7be9", "message": "Fixed a small bug in Bandpass.py.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T23:36:57Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80e106f7da699587fa303b8553204e46a702cc9d", "message": "Updated README with concise directions toward python example script.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T22:00:31Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "403a8fbf7df4f5f91f6f81775252f518c7d008aa", "message": "Added capability to plot bandpasses to photTools.py\n\nThis seemed like it would come up fairly often and be a useful\nvisualization, so I added plotBandpasses to photTools.py.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T21:31:14Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5ed0b9d81a46abf3df3eeb7ef647b28650366e0", "message": "Removed my email addy from README.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T20:28:58Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "685124f7cb9246797fcf1755eeebee9e6b177a85", "message": "Clarified a confusing comment.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T20:17:28Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2313b9ec9dc8b277152e711bc5a233e30690d5d5", "message": "Added plot generation to photTools, removed it from example.py", "created_at": "2012-06-21T20:11:31Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "da7d4b81871132eeb0e063f9e0cf2feb3cb71c5d", "message": "Added one more capability - instrumental magnitudes.\n\nAdded InstMags to photTools, and added commentary to example.py about\nthe differences between natural magnitudes, instrumental magnitudes,\nand what happens when we turn on calibration with the blue stars. Three\nplots comparing these situations are created.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T19:32:38Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d4ab1f3581dd138d84dba203b0686a97ec37bf74", "message": "Added git ignore for pyc files.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T18:59:22Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03af034fdc3dfd90ed13b609a0cbc924cef13b98", "message": "Added plots for all SEDS and updated photTools to add a bit more functionality for arbitrary SEDs.\n\nUpdated photTools so that can match magnitudes of bluest star between\nchanges in bandpass. Fixed errors in phot_ref.csh. Added plots for all\nSEDs and added the code to generate these plots.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T18:56:09Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2af7a15ac13870d584dcde7f97bea4f524f51cce", "message": "Updated detector prototype curve (name change).", "created_at": "2012-06-21T18:11:51Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "69e2ad6cc28a4e0f18083d2ba6ead9f44331115f", "message": "Starting repository.\n\nThis is a repository for some photometry reference samples.", "created_at": "2012-06-21T08:51:01Z", "repo": "photometry_sample", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "92d121c6f3d5bcbd9ca3653e08ee4603b8aeba4a", "message": "matching more generic throughputs repo", "created_at": "2015-12-05T06:07:59Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ebb74e70625e7447bc17f03911d5df53d72eb0c9", "message": "Fixed typo in main.", "created_at": "2014-09-03T23:09:33Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "855338afcdd97db4f85630e65ed31ca4027520ed", "message": "Deleted unused files, created 'run' method in main.", "created_at": "2014-09-03T23:08:08Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4c61725c43e4ead23fa088965d64805c15009bee", "message": "Removed some large output files that didn't need to be here.", "created_at": "2013-11-05T06:53:04Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2ed89e058d5b9ac56000afea8ce764769a345fe", "message": "Added file commenting on updating opsim in db to have interpolated values of seeing/clouds.", "created_at": "2013-11-05T06:47:03Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8d7e94eca4290e2319edaa81534c0262662c70f1", "message": "Updated camera+telescope contribution to seeing.\n\n(updated from 0.323\" to 0.38\" which is current expected performance).", "created_at": "2013-04-23T20:45:34Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "97c26f4ffb96353f634f7723bf6d9acf04c43822", "message": "Fixed bug in ObsFields.py when reading + checking observations.", "created_at": "2013-03-11T17:21:01Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "590d2fc9bf3429e43451afefd4ac9fdaf4491520", "message": "Updated .gitignore file.", "created_at": "2013-02-21T08:21:26Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a5d1de406be573ea6ebaef150779f47ecdca0af", "message": "Parallelized weather & skybrightness sections of code. Updated opsimSky.conf with new options.", "created_at": "2013-02-21T08:14:38Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "346a4640ad89cfc1a27cb6b19aefd81fdec8a329", "message": "Some updates to Weather_sqlite.py to make sure it has same interface as Weather.py", "created_at": "2012-10-11T23:58:03Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d88a1015810adc5c1838439f3f6be43f2ca9ef61", "message": "Made sure all comments were prefaced by # and corrected some errors in reading override file. Tested sqlite implementation and confirmed it was much slower than numpy version of Weather.py", "created_at": "2012-10-11T23:57:28Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "99c73a64e8efea545a339ba110c00a4eed2b7213", "message": "First commit, adding code.", "created_at": "2012-10-11T09:00:32Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "09490abfa21d830694c1574d7561dc65825e02e4", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2012-10-11T07:39:40Z", "repo": "OpsimObs", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c435ed5c31f9411ccf8e964cee215c7a5aa44de4", "message": "Create LICENSE.md", "created_at": "2016-01-28T22:41:22Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "888b7830c3135b7c7fa98244b381123c291aa149", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/rhiannonlynne/powerspectrum", "created_at": "2013-11-05T06:15:40Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "33131dd47293e621544ead550a17775a483ac070", "message": "Added code related to cloud generation from ARMA/Tim", "created_at": "2013-11-05T06:15:02Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "636c321d88f1728013ef33a60105046f52472600", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2013-09-03T19:32:45Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "869aee24438e633ff23d4f3976d25f24da262da2", "message": "Added updates to pImage to prevent accidental leakage of noise from SF -> image (resulting in linear features in image).", "created_at": "2013-05-20T10:17:52Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e3b5888a7ad3ff722e08f7c683e8d4e1871ebd7", "message": "Modified random phase spectrum so that phasespec[0][0] = 0 -- this preserves mean value of image.\nUpdated code and doc to match.", "created_at": "2013-04-25T07:08:19Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "726ad3597e4190f0c370b4112fd23c5b01c9d98b", "message": "Updated doc and figures with changes from ACF to ACovF.", "created_at": "2013-04-20T08:26:54Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6b4fd9edea4b8b2b12ed541a44e273f5b3b66b6", "message": "Added code to generate figures for powers_qs.tex (powers_qs.py), code to generate new clouds (moreClouds.py) and many figures/tex updates.", "created_at": "2013-04-18T09:47:03Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "125b0c5b7460267c57496e8e121faf9e93a2b03e", "message": "Added 'plotMore'  to PImagePlots to generate a plot of everything at once.", "created_at": "2013-04-16T10:17:58Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "406e710ec4381930c513705aa0b62bcf86b13881", "message": "Added example.py\n\nexample.py walks through construction & inverting the Image/FFT/PSD/ACF\n& 1d versions of the same. (!!)\nSee comments on how well each of these functions performs, when\nstarting from 1d cases and with/without phase information.", "created_at": "2013-04-16T01:24:02Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "953b55510d038517133a0682025dfffaaedb1898", "message": "Added testGaussian2.py\n\ntestGaussian2.py walks through various sigma/Nx combinations to test\nfor problems scaling the sigma of the gaussian in FFT/PSD/ACF", "created_at": "2013-04-16T00:43:05Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c0e34ccfb7175f90ab01d39d0702fc8fba81e8b", "message": "Deleted sin*png from repo (these were obsolete files).", "created_at": "2013-04-16T00:32:20Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f711c8585732563eba19519d55d04f4e1b7b77d", "message": "Updated test.py for changes in basic classes, and added testGaussian.py\n\ntestGaussian.py walks through the evaluation of a gaussian in\nImage/FFT/PSD/ACF space, with comparisons to the analytic expectation.", "created_at": "2013-04-16T00:28:47Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "946abab91dfb2adfeb0111da8082d48deefae76d", "message": "Update to basic utilities.\n\nSeparated basic utility (math - in pImage.py) from plotting (in\npImagePlots.py) from creating test data (in testImage.py). Fixed small\nbug in testImage.py that would make non-square images fail. Added\ncapability to invert FFT, PSD, and/or ACF (and 1d versions of PSD and\nACF) into Images (!!). Added calculation of structure function.", "created_at": "2013-04-15T21:53:30Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d09be1604080070f39f12251af3bd26ce006c2e2", "message": "Separate image generation routines from main functionality of PSD generation.\n\nTestImage will still do all of same functions (inherits from PImage)\nincluding generation of images - like adding circles, etc. The main\nfunctionality is now stand-alone in PImage (which makes this class a\nlittle more lightweight).", "created_at": "2013-03-22T01:15:49Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "33c293d2ace8173d97bc1d8a125936997e765a3b", "message": "Added code to determine binsize for radial profile histogram.\n\nBefore committing this, I also tested just fitting the radial profile;\nno go - not unexpected, since the fit would be trying to account for\nall the non-averaged data. In the end, I'm letting the user define the\nbinsize, or (else) using astroML to determine the optimum binsize using\nthe 'knuth' method, or (else) if astroML is not present, a default\nvalue is used.", "created_at": "2013-03-22T01:00:20Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "edac9d3efa10adab7bcf10150a5c084ef109b6cb", "message": "Updated testImage.py and added more tests to test.py\n\ntestImage.py updated with change to radial binning & new image\ngeneration routines, as well as new plotting method (to plot all images\nat once). test.py added with more test cases.", "created_at": "2013-03-21T09:23:31Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c21ba3ca69eb1ca10d74d72f11acf9f92639e9fd", "message": "Updated test to go through full range of plots.", "created_at": "2013-03-02T11:05:15Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d2b2c28b38cb1c5a542805d13976d6443ae2e9f", "message": "Updated PSD calculation (more correct), added frequency scaling, added ACF calculation.", "created_at": "2013-03-02T10:58:53Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9f13536a9665ad7bb567577ac8cca5d0abd47dc6", "message": "Removed radialProfile as am calculating within testImage now.", "created_at": "2013-03-02T10:58:17Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6090b0ffd11e108c41145d647175912f881b06cd", "message": "Fixed some small problems related to creating the aussian (scaling of peak). Updated test.py to use smaller gaussian.", "created_at": "2013-02-23T06:58:02Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b3426fe42bebdf5a65118f97bc9468d6380c850", "message": "Fixed horrible typo in makeFft so I actually do use the 2d FFT.", "created_at": "2013-02-23T00:25:19Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d8c03a2140a2fac3570ce685a70319ec2a35f84c", "message": "Added test script to run gaussian test.", "created_at": "2013-02-22T23:53:19Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f68c81a38d2bbd1dceec3fa0eae8a4200595acd7", "message": "Added addGaussian, fixed addEllipseGrid and added addEllipseRandom.\n\naddGaussian lets you add a gaussian function to image.\naddEllipseGrid now handles rotations for the ellipses (although it's\nnot super fast).\naddEllipseRandom lets you add ellipses at random angles/sizes/locations\n(any combination) to the image (again, not super fast, but ok for test\nimages).", "created_at": "2013-02-22T23:53:06Z", "repo": "powerspectrum", "file_sampled": fal